The component design, behavior, examples, skills and the documentation site
(site/) are derived from that project. The Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui
implementation was replaced with Mantine primitives and theme tokens, the
shadcn registry distribution was replaced with a single npm package, and the
parts tied to the 21st.dev Agent SDK (relay, sandbox and deploy flows) were
removed.

